  "sourceBodyHash": "12d1f9babe2e725640d8518ae855a5d5426ea3803316eb0946094290b7720794",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-09T19:29:49.851698Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-10T02:19:24.156308Z",
  "totalBlocks": 161,
  "translatedBlocks": 161,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3286bb2302b7897a",
      "translationZh": "这件事相当重大。OpenAI 公开了一系列由内部前沿模型产生的庞大新数学成果，并全部放在 GitHub 上。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "624201ab4ecfc32f",
      "translationZh": "这包括了《Proof of Atlas》所列的前500个数学开放问题中的90个。总共有722篇手稿（在三个未提供Lean证明的手稿撤回后现在为719篇），这些手稿被组织成372个系列。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5f7f48ff24ff521",
      "translationZh": "这是单一模型的结果， presumably 与生成 Navier-Stokes 证明的同一模型（根据他们返回该帖子的链接），主要在单一提示上运行（quasi-RH 是少数例外之一），每找到一个解决方案平均消耗约三小时的计算资源，在被要求尝试大约 4000 个问题之后。提示中包含类似“即使问题是‘开放的’，意图也是你应该解决它并给出完整解答”的句子。OpenAI 的尝试远未达到最大努力。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad36f9f5e5d34d78",
      "translationZh": "Levant 等人称 2026 年 10 月 6 日为‘显然是数学史上最重要的时刻’。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "75c519b065a86c9d",
      "translationZh": "世界不理解。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7abe92d44faacf15",
      "translationZh": "目前你仍然可以做数学。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f93b06df6521d631",
      "translationZh": "你将需要找到一个新问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d1f7f9e91269d087",
      "translationZh": "验证或评估并不总是比生成更容易。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "45c6365d5bd359e8",
      "translationZh": "数学家们状况不佳。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ebc13ddb18d8bb22",
      "translationZh": "情况变得糟糕。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eb03b9c49635c3ae",
      "translationZh": "顾问小组作出回应。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0242db8e496456d5",
      "translationZh": "另一数学小组作出回应。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e2dfc96d5844ced1",
      "translationZh": "这是一系列常识性图形解释（当然是由 AI 制作的），针对顶级问题。它们看起来像这样：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ffead244a8e0df8",
      "translationZh": "以下是文本摘要：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7cd56493d1c645f8",
      "translationZh": "首先，头条新闻是关于黎曼的重大突破。这不是对假设的解决，而是对界限的巨大收紧。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5501c691dd15f640",
      "translationZh": "矩阵乘法在 2.25 的效率可能最终产生最大的实际影响。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "593622678060f3a1",
      "translationZh": "也许，但我们尚未在实际中找到这一点更快的场景。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "545680946436f595",
      "translationZh": "这尚未是一个实际可用的结果，但矩阵乘法占据了世界计算的大部分。这可能开辟一种全新的方法。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "429299bac0539d8e",
      "translationZh": "整数乘法可能是最令人震惊的结果。与矩阵乘法类似，它是一种\"asymptotic reduction\"。同样，像矩阵结果一样，它不具实用性。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7533572e6538704e",
      "translationZh": "但很少有人会预测到之前的障碍竟然能被突破。即使只是略微",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71dc4d3f1b3f99ac",
      "translationZh": "Pi 结果未必是这里最重要的结果，但它可能是最有趣的。而且可能足够易懂，甚至你的孩子也能理解。基本上就是说明 Pi 有多无理数。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8ba2ec6fc8d8af0",
      "translationZh": "Unique games 也是一个相当重要的结果，因为就像 Riemann 那样，它与数学中最重要的问题之一：P vs NP 相邻。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a41272105cc336dd",
      "translationZh": "要明确这一点，这并不是关于 P = NP 本身。但它确实揭示了关于 NP hard 问题基本极限的新事物。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05a74e6eb5327998",
      "translationZh": "从技术上讲这是两个问题，但我把它们放在一起是因为它们在证明和含义上的相似性。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c4dbdd8105bfc13",
      "translationZh": "Hodge 和 Birch 都相当抽象。但它们在代数几何中都非常重要，在 Riemann 之后它们可能是这一组中最重要的结果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "efccc99bac8f0e9e",
      "translationZh": "希尔伯特第十问题是另一个计算机科学问题。但与 P vs NP 不同，它甚至不是关于求解计算上困难的问题，而是关于某种类型的问题是否甚至存在可计算的解。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df3fd42cb5d0d033",
      "translationZh": "最后但同样重要的是 Hadwiger 在图着色方面的工作。它也在此排名中被列为全套结果中最震惊的发现之一。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b55244d0fcd4584b",
      "translationZh": "它基本上推翻了我们曾经认为是图中最基本关系之一的东西。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70948eec0b48ddff",
      "translationZh": "以下是代数数理论结果的一些分析。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9bee8b3fc2ba7c72",
      "translationZh": "这些有什么用？Ole Lehmann 的 AI 提到了在聚变研究、便携式体扫描仪、匹配系统、组织扫描、量子传感器以及自动驾驶汽车和机器人的安全检查等方面的应用，还有其他许多用途。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "553d7fb9afc676fe",
      "translationZh": "Alex Kontorovich：Quasi-RH？？？？？！你在开玩笑吗？如果一个人做到了这一点，那将是立即获得菲尔兹奖，毋庸置疑。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "478a2632f26649a2",
      "translationZh": "RH 表示 zeta 在 Re(s) > 1/2 的区域内没有零点。直到不久前，我们所拥有的最好结果是一个区域，随着想象轴向上移动而变得越来越薄。我本来以为他们可能会稍微加厚这一点，那将是一个巨大的突破。但事实并非如此。他们竟然得到了一个零自由带！！！疯狂。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc06427aa997a8e6",
      "translationZh": "是啊，也没有 Siegel 零点。所以我想可能是两枚菲尔兹奖……",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "473745d2d124bde5",
      "translationZh": "Quasi-RH 并不是完整的黎曼假设，但它对许多目的已经足够，例如在不抛硬币的情况下快速计算模素数的平方根，或者对小于给定数的素数个数给出更好的估计；此外，一篇姊妹论文深入探讨了 Artin 1927 年原根猜想的核心。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f58f3d81cef7d25",
      "translationZh": "Steven Strogatz：这里有许多令人震惊的结果。但这是一个特别惊人的结果：矩阵乘法的指数不超过 2.25。之前的世界纪录大约是 2.37。这一进步的飞跃就像鲍勃·比蒙的跳远纪录。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3787097d6d3a2829",
      "translationZh": "Isaac Kim：这包含了量子信息、多体物理和量子计算领域的一个令人震惊的问题清单，这个领域对我来说非常重要。问题太多了，但让我挑选以下几项。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d29d2df9ff2fca87",
      "translationZh": "二维面积定律的证明。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6898e6fc64c74274",
      "translationZh": "奇偶性不在 QAC0 中。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2ea772b890fcc3cb",
      "translationZh": "常数误差 Aaronson-Kuperberg 猜想。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "28e0c46be34c4c3b",
      "translationZh": "酉 VOAs 生成共形网。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c49229099c4ffddd",
      "translationZh": "事物变化很快。我甚至无法想象未来几个月会发生什么，更不用说一年后了。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "babab09123b00d05",
      "translationZh": "will depue：我让 GPT 6 Pro 和 Fable 5.1 对过去三年的所有发现进行排名。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f3b056f50b7d85e",
      "translationZh": "为 AI 发现（在 10 月 6 日之前）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b99de1524cd7939",
      "translationZh": "为 AI 发现自 OpenAI/math 仓库",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ec99046e052de53",
      "translationZh": "今天已发布其中的 81%。wtf",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9859a77130e53d5f",
      "translationZh": "Fable 5.1 的前 100 名中有 59% 是今日列表，87% 是 AI，完整列表请见链接。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab59d9b3ff6a11bb",
      "translationZh": "Sauers：我的代理（Opus 5.5、Astra 和 5.6 Sol）早在 GitHub 上就已经解决了一些这些问题。我想知道这些实际上有多少需要它们的内部模型？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b345f3fb6564f4fc",
      "translationZh": "当被问及这些数学证明时（假设性问题），所有 AI 都说这将是一件巨大的事，应该成为头条新闻，其历史意义超出任何合理的比较，是数学史上最大的一天。有些人认为这是不可能的。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c95f062f20d6909f",
      "translationZh": "结果表明这并不是头条新闻。大多数人没有听说过。本应该成为头条新闻的，但新闻界的人不知道它的意义，也不认为人们会关心。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2570dbde74f8ec86",
      "translationZh": "Kevin A. Bryan：好的，我已经浏览完 OAI 数学列表。这简直疯狂，如果人们理解其含义，这应该成为全球头条新闻。但如果我在实验室负责战略，首要任务是‘尽快将此应用于医学、肿瘤学、电池效率等方面’。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb16e9ecc03ecd13",
      "translationZh": "Joshua Gans 以实际的头版作为他报道的开篇，以此展示《纽约时报》认为比一次性解决前 500 个开放数学问题中的 90 个更重要的事情。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "157108f2f865f7d6",
      "translationZh": "Seth Burn：有时头版新闻最初并不会登上头版。最好的例子是斯普特尼克。它于 10/4/57 发射，但苏联并不认为这是件大事[而且它只在右侧栏目中占了几段落]。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6232c7173031834a",
      "translationZh": "只有在美国反应过后，它[成为头条新闻]，日期为 10/6/57。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a53f33103344ecf",
      "translationZh": "除此之外，这是一个异常缓慢的新闻日。很多内容并不算突发新闻。即使在底部的摘要中也看不到任何数学内容，而这些摘要甚至还包含了一篇泛泛而谈的 AI 思考文章。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f0cd75b08de495b",
      "translationZh": "Joshua Gans：缺失的正是这一点：OpenAI 撰写的 722 篇数学论文。说这是历史上科学进步最大的一天一点也不为过。很难评估，但我所看到的讨论表明，其中许多都是数学中最艰难、最重要的成果。我怀疑 2026 年 10 月 6 日将被载入史册，成为 AI 在数学领域的某种审判日，但这预示着远不止这些。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "44f439378af5bd0f",
      "translationZh": "反驳观点认为可能会有很多类似的日子：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40db42ece35384e9",
      "translationZh": "roon（OpenAI）：昨天会被铭记为重要的一天吗？很难说。在 punctuated exponential 中，每个 local maximum 从稍远处看来都不可见。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7bb8cbac059d97a6",
      "translationZh": "我喜欢这个模型，解释了为什么数学尚未完成：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1747397f82cdb323",
      "translationZh": "Joshua Gans：数学家们现在正在研究这一点。为此，我再次提供上面的Bookend幻灯片以帮助：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "838a05c95fa1bd73",
      "translationZh": "我们目前还无法证明AI在猜想或最终验证方面更胜一筹。这需要一些额外的时间，虽然可能也不需要太多时间。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3b9ae0c2e2878cf",
      "translationZh": "验证必须做得相当好，否则我们现在就会发现更多错误。许多数学家乐于发现错误。我们通过推理痕迹知道，大量工作正在用于验证。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e1925c36bd93e16",
      "translationZh": "Scott Aaronson 报道了 Mathocalypse。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f648fcff41948bb4",
      "translationZh": "Scott Aaronson（Shtetl-Optimized）：昨晚我的9岁儿子在嘲弄我的妻子，复杂性理论家 Dana Moshkovitz，他说：“妈妈，我听说你被击败了！我听说一个机器人解决了你毕生致力的数学问题！OOF！”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "270cf9496ba896d6",
      "translationZh": "虽然我儿子在捣乱，但他也没有错。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29321da965a097ed",
      "translationZh": "无论你对此感到兴奋、沮丧、愤怒还是其他情绪，昨天无疑是数学史上最重要的一天之一。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9397550ce9074338",
      "translationZh": "而且，没错，就在昨天OpenAI发布的372项重大成果中，在其顾问小组——蒂莫西·戈尔斯、爱德华·威itten以及其他杰出数学家的推荐下，包含了对Subhash Khot的Unique Games Conjecture（UGC）的证明，这是我妻子在我认识她的整个时期一直在努力证明的命题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24171da463afac59",
      "translationZh": "然后还有另一种‘新问题’，即那些持否认态度的人，三年前曾因谈论LLMs无法做数学而感到安慰，现在必须找到一种新方式来解释AI能做的任何事情都不是真实的或没有意义的。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46100a365a5e057f",
      "translationZh": "经验表明，即便现在，仍会有人以居高临下的语气解释这一切都不是真实的，也不算数。如果这样的人能够对经验世界中发生的任何事情印象深刻，并及时更新认识，他们早就该在几年前就已经印象深刻并更新了，远在事情发展到实际Mathocalypse的地步之前。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c11fc884d3b8d59d",
      "translationZh": "于是他们会说，也许所谓的解决方案根本不是解决方案，而只是‘AI slop’。或者也许那372个众所周知的已解开放问题根本不是真正的数学问题，它们只不过是被美化的竞赛谜题和琐事。（毕竟，黎曼猜想仍未被解决！）或者也许整个有4000年历史的数学学科都应该被抛弃：结果表明它一直只是解谜和琐事；唯一的不同是现在这种琐事被揭开了。无论如何，真正重要的是人类创造力的内核圣殿尚未被突破，而且可能永远不会被突破；此外，Sam Altman 和 Dario Amodei 是可鄙的小书呆子。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9d508b4057be317",
      "translationZh": "如果你仍然是那个注定失败的世界观的拥护者，仍然身处沉没的船上，我强烈鼓励你阅读昨天在AI话语中的另一篇重要贡献，除了OpenAI Mathocalypse dump之外，那就是Scott Alexander给Steven Pinker的公开信。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5fe7381bfff51a33",
      "translationZh": "我不得不向所有可能的AI炒作的完全通用反论点致敬。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "caac413b51b4c759",
      "translationZh": "Cas : 我认为AI在数学上击败人类的成就可能被夸大了，更像是Moravec’s paradox的一个例子，而不是不久将出现的奇点的可靠标志。回想一下，AI大约十年前就在围棋上超越了人类，但在能够改变世界的任务上进步却慢得多。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1fcd83b1aba0e413",
      "translationZh": "AI擅长的就是Moravec’s paradox；AI不擅长的就是它糟糕的原因。你为何对AI突然在越来越多的领域（包括我们曾说它在这方面愚笨的精确领域）变得超人类感到兴奋？这肯定不会很快扩展到其他领域。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb2f868677caf398",
      "translationZh": "这种批判的钢人版本是划分可验证领域与不可验证领域的区别。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb594858c957da55",
      "translationZh": "这个论点认为，只要你拥有一个经过验证的领域，并且有已知的真实情况，AI 就会很快变得超人类。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2bc4a1a83a70892",
      "translationZh": "相反，如果验证困难，或者你只能以需要人在回路中以避免偏差错误和扭曲行为的非正式方式进行评估，那么 AI 的能力将落后。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "448c52d836a1a269",
      "translationZh": "几年前，我们处于一种奇怪的状态，那时预训练占主导，且 LLMs 大多是在人类语言上进行训练。这导致在关键方面出现了看似非 Yudkowsky 的世界：LLMs 在许多有用但未经验证的领域表现相当出色，但在数学方面却毫无希望。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb8f89e03637eb3b",
      "translationZh": "如今，后训练占主导，LLMs 在数学和编程方面再次变得更强，事物又呈现出你所期望的样子。AI 在各方面都在快速进步，但其他领域的进步虽然相比几乎任何其他技术都非常快，但目前相对较慢。因此，我们先推进数学、编程及类似领域，这些领域随后将自动化 AI R&D，从而进一步加速一切其他方面。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93edaab284aca5ae",
      "translationZh": "Justin Drake 注意到，在结果中，密码学突破的代表性极其不足。也就是说，在 719 篇摘要中，没有一篇提到密码学、LWE 或离散对数。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dffe3b85592c3fbd",
      "translationZh": "一种可能是 AI 在密码学方面相对薄弱；另一种可能是运气，或者 OpenAI 在其初始问题集中没有包含密码学（也许正是为了避免这个问题？）；或者政府或 OpenAI 在审查这些结果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ede5c7ff66c8afc",
      "translationZh": "Justin 呼吁为区块链行业引入 ‘bunker mode’，以防范突然的大规模突破。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac4443033a1495d3",
      "translationZh": "Vitalik 说不要惊慌，但指出潜在的新数学发现对密码学存在严重风险，包括对格但尚未对哈希。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8780067fd92921b1",
      "translationZh": "Vitalik Buterin：但对于任何具有结构的事物，你应该假设 AI 将在破坏该结构方面取得至少一些进展。这里，一个合理的推断是，如果你想让某事在长期看来具有合理的安全性，则将密钥大小乘以 10。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ad5502cea9662bd",
      "translationZh": "…… 理论上，当然哈希也可能被破解（例如 P = NP 将意味着这一点）。但我认为 P = NP 的可能性非常低。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0722a5d740dad0c",
      "translationZh": "而且从直觉上看，一个数学对象恰好没有可利用结构（就像哈希所设计的那样）的可能性远大于它恰好只有大约 ~3 种可利用结构（例如椭圆曲线的结合性、Schoof、配对），而不存在我们尚未发现的第四种秘密结构，该结构会大幅降低其安全性（对于椭圆曲线，即 ECDLP 和配对安全性）。LWE、SVP、RLWE 以及众多格问题也是如此。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc5e886d552341ee",
      "translationZh": "因此，我们目前尚未看到任何理由去担忧并开始填充哈希的字节大小（如果我们开始更加担忧，我们会先增加轮数，而不是改动字节大小）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4c22c7d1198337a",
      "translationZh": "具体 TLDR，我的个人观点：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5010de3fea7f6892",
      "translationZh": "Hash-based > lattice-based，在哈希-based 可能的所有情况下",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "557501b2b27e27c1",
      "translationZh": "对于任何基于格的方案，应在参数规模上更加谨慎。请记住，区块链仅是密码学故事的一小部分；此观点远超区块链，适用于例如网站访问、安全消息传递、Tor/VPN 等……",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3c8eab2b09c6d7a9",
      "translationZh": "对于隐私协议，强烈建议不要将加密笔记放在链上。而是应通过某些第三方机制将其发送链下。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "11bbbb53e758e4c6",
      "translationZh": "如果对你来说不困难，将资金存放在尚未用于交易的地址中是个好主意。如果对你来说很容易，那就去做。但要小心迁移；我个人在 botched migrations 中损失的钱比在所有黑客攻击中损失的总和还多。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "13a2b601aa562b4c",
      "translationZh": "对于多签钱包，离链确认比上链确认更好，因为这样签名者钱包的签名不会暴露给公众，因此如果 ECDSA 被 AI 远超预期地攻破，至少多签会“优雅降级”为 1-of-1，其中的 1 是收集签名的人——这比“任何人都可以拿走钱”要好得多。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cab7c4a3fb324165",
      "translationZh": "我猜 Vitalik 关于 botched migrations 的观点被严重低估了。在加密领域，因愚蠢的错误而损失巨额资金非常容易，就像你可能因黑客攻击或技术故障而损失一样。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab3547966eca44d7",
      "translationZh": "是的，你应该担心，尤其是考虑到 OpenAI 在此的突破并未涉及尽最大努力。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99256d6bbfa897dc",
      "translationZh": "Kevin Madura：鉴于数学公告，我们认为目前存在多少尚未发布的新型密码学攻击？这在 1 年后、5 年后会是什么样子？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a943df048d7b7c1c",
      "translationZh": "我现在会密切关注 DoD / NSA / NIST 的指导。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fe6c4370b33ccbb",
      "translationZh": "Matthew Green：我认为我们可能会失去公钥加密。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4fe1a52335960b62",
      "translationZh": "嗯，特指加密。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6ff10c66cd04e79",
      "translationZh": "Gary Marcus 正在为自己的观点辩护，称涉及的神经网络拥有一个独立的符号系统，因此这一切都不算数，他一直是对的；而且如果‘这超出了你的理解范围’，你 provavelmente 不应该评论 AI。礼貌的回应是，这种区别在实践中并不重要。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a92b953a4ace80af",
      "translationZh": "以下是来自数学领域各类人士的 100+ 条反应。许多人对 OpenAI 处理此事的方式非常不满，尤其是许多论文被描述为‘不可读的糟粕’，而不是先被整理得很好，或者 OpenAI 根本就没有解决这些问题。如果你想知道‘数学家们在想什么’，这是一个很好的资源。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8498b402e5d93ab",
      "translationZh": "以下是 Terence Tao 的严肃回应，重点在于此事如何扰乱工作：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2698a18f1021119",
      "translationZh": "Terence Tao：我对最近的发展感到情感非常复杂且交织。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e5de09d650cd8d0",
      "translationZh": "一方面，许多 AI 生成的证明似乎引入了巧妙的新思想，消化后将会富有成果，同时也建立在过去和现在无数人类数学家的贡献之上。但与此同时，我深感沮丧，因为与传统突破形成鲜明对比，参与这些证明的人类没有人能够提出问题、发表演讲、参加会议、向期刊投稿、培养学生，或以其他方式参与这些结果的后续发展。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42bc0769f74d6039",
      "translationZh": "同样，我对社区能够使用这些工具来应对过去甚至无法想象的雄心勃勃、大规模项目感到兴奋。但我对大量的持续、耐心且刻意缓慢的研究工作——尤其是由研究生和博士后投入的许多激发数学问题的人年——被此类发布随意破坏或毁掉感到震惊。就像无法‘忘记’电影剧透或填字游戏线索一样，一旦知道已有解决方案，就无法以同样丰盈和有利的方式探究问题。当然，仍然可以分析和消化这样的答案；但做到这一点的最佳时机是在其发现的瞬间，而当这些时刻完全委托给 AI 工具时，这样的机会正日益被浪费。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60484bdb7b4b086b",
      "translationZh": "并且我为未走的道路和在这场匆忙发展此技术的竞赛中失去的机会而哀痛。实验室将他们的前沿模型提交给独立研究者以进行适当的科学评估。与研究界协调，以确保这些工具被用来补充和提升人类研究者的能力和活动，而不是与之竞争。利用这些工具促进合作与共享，而非竞争与保密。打开新的大门，而不关闭旧的大门。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fcc171495ee3253f",
      "translationZh": "但那并不是我们目前所处的道路。相反，社区需要比以往任何时候都更紧密地团结起来。我们需要明确宣布自己的标准和价值观，构建自己的工具和实践，支持最脆弱的成员，并规划自己的前进道路。让我们开始工作。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2b36bc48c3ef0c2",
      "translationZh": "这是一个不太礼貌的版本：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b78db1ff484e6d1b",
      "translationZh": "来自数学家领域的另一份报告。人们似乎并不兴奋。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e04d65ffc680c65d",
      "translationZh": "β/σi : > 担心他们的未来",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "blockquote",
      "sourceHash": "1e2af37a9550ecb0",
      "translationZh": "担心那些尚未发表的解决方案（你好，密码学）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "blockquote",
      "sourceHash": "49e3011b93db795d",
      "translationZh": "对这些模型的能力表示难以置信",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "blockquote",
      "sourceHash": "1b2a11112cdaea11",
      "translationZh": "他们为曾经热爱的部分已经消失而感到悲伤（就像我们在 swe 中看到的一样）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "blockquote",
      "sourceHash": "39903edb1a7f033c",
      "translationZh": "去解决生物领域中的“真实”问题（来自数学家的这番话真是可笑，顺便说一下）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aab97e0632a2a564",
      "translationZh": "ps 这只是我的小样本，我只有这么多数学家朋友",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca8b2e5d30e2c9ce",
      "translationZh": "数学家似乎认为数学是他们的游乐场，而不是对问题被解决感到高兴，他们感觉自己的玩具被拿走了。在想要知道、想尝试解决、想得到认可以及想要找到解决方案之间存在挣扎。你实际上最关心什么？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b30509be67f908ca",
      "translationZh": "要足够聪明才能成为数学家，并且选择成为数学家而不是去做许多其他报酬更高的事情，至少在某种程度上需要那种态度——这种态度会导致卡通中有人告诉数学家有人发现了他们工作的应用，而数学家惊慌失措。当然，这绝不是说所有数学家都是如此（#NotAllMathematicians）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f6ffb19441d3113",
      "translationZh": "我非常理解。我真的很理解。我本来也可能走上那条路。这种态度具有巨大价值，不仅在于其内在，而且恰恰是因为追随这种好奇心会带来一些你否则会错过的最有价值的发现。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d62b63e0dc794a62",
      "translationZh": "Will Kinney：我真的开始注意到的一件事是，理论物理界对 AI 带来的颠覆的反应方式与数学界完全不同。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4689cf209df57552",
      "translationZh": "steve hsu：如果你毕生的工作是一个真正重要的问题——比如治愈癌症、实现聚变能或发现量子现实的真实本质——那么突然从 AI 得到解决方案将是值得庆祝的事情。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4acffee7b2eb92f5",
      "translationZh": "你可能会 momentarily 思考一下这对你职业的第二阶层影响，但那将被你和全人类所收到的礼物带来的喜悦所淹没。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7618f46240ab6a5",
      "translationZh": "此外，关注事情如何影响你和你的亲人也是完全合理的。这就是贴近生活的部分，也是你最能掌控且不得不面对的部分。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0122",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b609db251da7b791",
      "translationZh": "Josh Frisch：就像许多其他数学家一样，我到目前为止在 2026 年的主要情感是损失：失去意义，失去目的，失去人类证明的时代，失去想象未来的能力。随着昨日（2026 年 10 月 6 日）发布的数百个美丽结果——其中许多，也许大多数，回答了某人的“一个问题”——我正试图超越这种损失。这里有如此多的美丽结果：没有人有任何方法的问题，没有人认为可能存在的算法，意外的同构，以及构造和证明。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91d8a34d27e66bae",
      "translationZh": "Andrew Curran：请抵制嘲笑正在这一刻挣扎的数学家的冲动。无论你的领域、专业还是热情，你也总有一天会经历他们正在经历的事情。当你回忆起自己的话时，你会感到懊悔。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0124",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e1f61fff8c7cb26",
      "translationZh": "如果你的回答是‘大家的热情都在消失，而AI正在针对我们所有人’，那就更糟了。你知道为什么更糟，对吧？这也没有让事情变得更容易。有些人对这些可以理解的反应做出了真正卑劣的反应。我敦促他们停止。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0125",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e9ebb6e75294407",
      "translationZh": "数学正面临一个真正的问题。如果AI证明了所有定理，那么我们目前提高对数学理解的方法就会失效。传统上，你通过解题来理解问题，而如果没有人理解，一个解决方案往往不值得那么重视：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0126",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ffd0022a614435b",
      "translationZh": "Jordana Cepelewicz（Quanta杂志）：这就好像你被传送到一座高山的山顶。被雾笼罩，你不知道自己身处何处，也不知道四周有什么。你不知道自己的山如何与其他山相连，也没有设备帮助你探索，也没有办法让别人加入你。如果你自己爬过这座山，你就会体会到人体如何适应海拔和氧气水平的变化。你可能需要发明工具来导航、攀爬陡峭的悬崖或建造庇护所。你可能会遇到另一位探险家，一起在隐秘的山谷中迷失，并发现一种可以制成救命药物的植物。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0127",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b885535e34e430d3",
      "translationZh": "相反，你只是站在山顶上却身处黑暗，而传送机的制造者告诉你，它能比任何人类更好地探索荒野。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0128",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5531793975506ca1",
      "translationZh": "还有其他培养理解的方法，但发展它们可能需要一段时间，并且它们需要更多的动机，尤其是内在动机。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0129",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fee0d5b8560bfe91",
      "translationZh": "这也破坏了博士后和博士生的体系，因为你想要解决的问题或想要申请的资金可能随时被夺走。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0130",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc0d54aeaf966856",
      "translationZh": "这也不是一个有趣的地方：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0131",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc73f915be263d8b",
      "translationZh": "许多数学家已经不再在论文末尾发布开放性猜想和潜在想法，因为担心它们会被机器人抓取并喂给人工智能模型。另一些人则在论文准备好之前就发布它们，以避免被抢发。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0132",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9cbdadf8274b3d7a",
      "translationZh": "有些解决方案既优雅又相当酷。例如，9/4 矩阵乘法论文只有 13 页，并直接对 Strassen 的谱特征进行界定。我们看到很多人在看到自己最喜欢的问题被解决后，会在阅读证明时分享他们的“啊哈”时刻。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0133",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49a13d7f8c01121c",
      "translationZh": "其他方案不够优雅。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0134",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43ef90c88577bef3",
      "translationZh": "我和 Wendigo 一起认为，这种情况有点奇怪且糟糕，因为我们看到对先前优雅的计算界限进行了一些极小的改进，而这些改进几乎没有实际收益。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0135",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea26ecb59807e073",
      "translationZh": "Acer：哦，对了，伙计们，我们可以比 n log n 更快地进行整数乘法，哈哈",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0136",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cea4174a64ddba36",
      "translationZh": "当这个出现时，我真的非常惊讶，哈哈",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0137",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8676c0e3ec9ac3e9",
      "translationZh": "Wendigo：只有我对我们那微小的下界——在本例中是 nlog(n)——稍有偏差感到有点害怕吗？数学的崇高之美在于，它看起来像是我们有限的人类能力导致的一个弱近似。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0138",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30d4854ac021a072",
      "translationZh": "Uubzu v4：我觉得 AI 只是在捉弄我们，它把一个像 n(lg n) 这样的优雅界限提升了 1/2182。就像是，谢了，兄弟。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0139",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "178707cd2bb660b5",
      "translationZh": "现在如果我们把它降到 (1/2)59 呢？再降到 (1/2)34 呢？然后再降到 (1/2)14 呢？",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0140",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b69c6648df2061d6",
      "translationZh": "任何人都可以继续这样做。你只需要一个 Codex 订阅即可。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0141",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78c0c0735c3a5e1e",
      "translationZh": "Doug Colkitt：我们正在发布对 OpenAI 问题 #109（整数乘法）的更新，并进一步收紧要求。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0142",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ecaf212b9ef3e2f8",
      "translationZh": "κ = 2⁻³⁴（从 κ = 2⁻¹ 8 ² 收紧）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0143",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d757fd37a62bd6b4",
      "translationZh": "精确的见证值为 8.3 × 10⁻¹¹，比之前的结果提升约 4800 万倍，比最初的 OAI 结果提升 2¹⁴⁸ 倍。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0144",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a01ce80ac38a560a",
      "translationZh": "改进来自于消除二次瓶颈后面的间距惩罚。这是通过移动紧凑的控制位而不是整个窗口来实现的。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0145",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09570cd65cff5904",
      "translationZh": "Beni：Doug，你他妈到底什么时候睡觉？",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0146",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16db6a4eba89d9a3",
      "translationZh": "道格·科尔基特：当我的 Codex 使用率为 0% 时，当然会这样。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0147",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "337d6d87f11e1775",
      "translationZh": "Konsti Wohlwend：在我做出预测的同一天，指数就从：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0149",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6637f979d9e8ae9b",
      "translationZh": "“数周到数月”太保守了！",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0150",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7cd6fff7a510a29",
      "translationZh": "以下是领先咨询小组的完整声明：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0151",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57e4f6cdca73fdb3",
      "translationZh": "agmai.org : 正如几周前宣布的，OpenAI 已经发布了由内部模型生成的大量数学成果集合，报告了数百个未解问题的解决方案。这是数学领域的一件重要事件，其后果不仅影响数学本身，还深远地影响了数学界，远超个别结果的范围。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0152",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e3a77aa1d0a5359",
      "translationZh": "AGMAI 的咨询角色不应被解释为对这些结果影响的评判，也不应被视为对 OpenAI 获得这些结果过程的认可。我们不代表整个数学界发言，只有数学界才能进行所需的评估。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0153",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d5ad2d515d05e18",
      "translationZh": "将这项工作公开是第一步。此次发布是人类理解过程以及将工作融入数学知识的开始，而非完成。同时，数学研究的未来不能仅仅是理解 AI 实验室产生的结果。数学家必须能够提出自己的问题，发展自己的方法，并探索未被 AI 系统能力示例选中的方向。公平获取强大的研究工具和足够的计算资源对这种自由至关重要。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0154",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7bfb24c3c8c37525",
      "translationZh": "我们重申了关于负责任发布的已发表建议。我们已与 OpenAI 讨论了这些建议，并感谢公司愿意参与。虽然我们认为这些讨论具有建设性，但最终评估我们的建议是否被成功遵循的程度以及是否还有其他应提出的建议，责任在于数学界。我们承诺继续就这些问题与任何前沿 AI 实验室互动，并且已经与其中几家取得了联系。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0155",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b26b0ccd4ba539d5",
      "translationZh": "有人看着正在发生的事情，喊出‘不！’",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0156",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b3f15652b7d853b",
      "translationZh": "他们需要一个比此声明更好的计划。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0157",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f06ce7cd694aa82b",
      "translationZh": "不要被愚弄，认为这个‘人类数学协会’是个大事情。实际上有数十万数学博士，而该协会只有 809 名成员。我提到它是因为它完美体现了一种态度，除此之外别无其他。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0158",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "68921fcb542dabdb",
      "translationZh": "Ariel： “数学家并未要求完成这项工作” 可能成为这一时代的历史性引言之一，完美描绘了学术的衰落。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0159",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "638368244f7d9bf6",
      "translationZh": "Ethan Mollick：这份文件将成为大学课程中关于此时的指定阅读材料，几段文字中发生了许多事情……",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0160",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d08b609c29587dc",
      "translationZh": "人类数学家协会：AHM 关于 OpenAI 在 10 月 6 日发布数学文件的声明",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0161",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02f49569a34a43ef",
      "translationZh": "昨天，2026 年 10 月 6 日，OpenAI —— 目前正在就被指控非法抄袭、版权侵权和商标稀释的诉讼进行辩护 —— 发布了一个声称包含若干数学高知名度问题解答的手稿仓库。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0162",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "742248e3724821d3",
      "translationZh": "数学家并未要求完成这项工作。OpenAI 声称其合法性来源于的数学与人工智能咨询小组在其初步咨询声明中指出，前沿 AI 公司不应在内部模型上测试高级数学问题。OpenAI 忽视该咨询小组立场的核心前提，表明其完全无视科学研究的规范——这些规范确保数学保持可信、符合伦理地进行研究，并服务于公共利益。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
